  "sourceTitle": "Thinking that we’ll get safety by CoT traces is wishful thinking. Safety lives in the harness, not the chain of thought",
  "sourceBodyHash": "ef6991d9017d9556b54589d880d74244c92fee98c5fadd7f8ee0a6adfe2dcd6e",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
